{"timestamp": "2025-09-10T19:01:03.967686", "function_name": "craft", "function_body": "  # Get the index of the desired item from the cookbook index\n  goal_index = env.world.cookbook.index[item]\n\n  # Get the primitives required for the goal\n  primitive_counts = env.world.cookbook.primitives_for(goal_index)\n\n  # Check if all required primitives are in the inventory\n  have_all_primitives = True\n  for primitive, count in primitive_counts.items():\n    if env._current_state.inventory[primitive] < count:\n      have_all_primitives = False\n      break\n\n  # If we do not have all required primitives, return an empty action list\n  if not have_all_primitives:\n    return []\n\n  # Find the workshop specified in the recipe for the goal item\n  workshop_index_str = env.world.cookbook.recipes[goal_index][\"_key\"]\n  workshop_type = int(workshop_index_str[-1])\n\n  # Find the position of the nearest workshop in the grid\n  min_distance = float('inf')\n  target_workshop_pos = None\n\n  for y in range(env._current_state.grid.shape[0]):\n      for x in range(env._current_state.grid.shape[1]):\n          if env._current_state.grid[y, x, env.world.workshop_indices[workshop_type]] == 1:\n              distance = abs(y - env._current_state.pos[0]) + abs(x - env._current_state.pos[1])\n              if distance < min_distance:\n                  min_distance = distance\n                  target_workshop_pos = (y, x)\n\n  # If no workshop is found, return an empty action list\n  if target_workshop_pos is None:\n    return []\n\n  actions = []\n\n  # Navigate to the nearest workshop\n  path_to_workshop = navigate_to(env._current_state.pos, target_workshop_pos)\n  actions.extend(path_to_workshop)\n\n  # Turn to face the workshop\n  final_direction = calculate_direction(env._current_state.pos, target_workshop_pos)\n  actions.append(final_direction)\n\n  # Perform USE action to craft the item at the workshop\n  actions.append(craft.ACTION_USE)\n\n  return actions", "island_id": 